      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "`learn.py`, POST\n`/settings/learn/apply`. Proposes\nnew values from \ud83d\udc4d/\ud83d\udc4e feedback, but\nONLY for the `reco` and `album`\ngroups \u2014 `artist_score` is never\nauto-tuned",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "`learn.py`, POST\n`/settings/learn/apply`. Proposes\nnew values from \ud83d\udc4d/\ud83d\udc4e feedback, but\nONLY for the `reco` and `album`\ngroups \u2014 `artist_score` is never\nauto-tuned",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
