      "type": "text",
      "text": "`album.*` group\n(`Ctx.album_score`, same function\nserves album AND track).\nlabel=0.4, artist=0.4, style=0.2,\nartist_max_vs_mean=0.6. Hardcoded\n(not configurable) shrinkage:\nK=0.35, PRIOR=45, pulling\nthin-evidence scores toward a\nneutral 45/100",
